Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Undo edge-fake-mdm.reg — removes the synthetic MDM enrollment.
; Run elevated. After this, the device reports as unmanaged again and Edge will
; once more show off-store force-install entries as [BLOCKED]. Restart Edge to apply.

